  "details": "When a group owner launches a group instance, users who do not have the role cannot join.\n\nWhen starting the instance, there is an item to select a role, and “All” is selected.\n\nExcept for the group owner, everyone in the group can set up an instance that is open to all participants in the group.\n\nThis problem seems to occur only for group owner.\n\nGroup members without role can try to join from the current location of the group owner, but will get an error 403 that they do not have permission to access.\n\nThe Everyone role is granted permission to join a Group instance.\n\nWe also found that we can join by creating and granting a new role that only has the authority to join to a group instance.",
